{"content_hash": "f0be584f43d45c5b", "version_id": 542, "article_id": 55, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Solanke scores late, 10-man Spurs draw 1-1 with Man Utd", "title_zh": "索兰克补时进球，十人热刺1-1逼平曼联", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "bbc_sport", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/football/videos/crz9zdl0g04zo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590701722867-95e186ddbc24?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8M3x8c29sYW5rZSUyMHNjb3JlcyUyMGFkZGVkfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE2NzgxMzh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Weigler Godoy on Unsplash", "author": "Weigler Godoy", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@weigler?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-group-of-soccer-players-playing-a-game-of-soccer-JvccQap9IxQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(326, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(4, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "6686c357331f"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-10", "word_count": 93, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "Tottenham played with only ten men at Old Trafford. But Dominic Solanke scored late to save a point for his team.", "lead_zh": "热刺在老特拉福德只剩十人应战。但多米尼克·索兰克在最后时刻进球，为球队抢回一分。", "preview": "Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 on Sunday. The match was at Old Trafford, United's home stadium. It was a feisty game with ", "preview_zh": "周日，曼联与托特纳姆热刺1-1战平。比赛在曼联的主场老特拉福德进行。这是一场火药味十足的比赛，身体对抗很多。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 531, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/55/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 38.537, "size_bytes": 235008, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 108, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fc48a26/content/data/versions/542.json", "paragraphs": ["Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 on Sunday. The match was at Old Trafford, United's home stadium. It was a feisty game with many strong challenges.", "Tottenham had only ten players for part of the match. A player got a red card. But the team did not give up.", "Dominic Solanke scored in added time. He found the net in stoppage time. His goal saved a point for Tottenham.", "The result means both teams take one point. United stay in the Premier League. Tottenham also get one point from the away game."], "paragraphs_zh": ["周日，曼联与托特纳姆热刺1-1战平。比赛在曼联的主场老特拉福德进行。这是一场火药味十足的比赛，身体对抗很多。", "热刺在比赛的一部分时间里只有十名球员。一名球员被红牌罚下。但球队没有放弃。", "多米尼克·索兰克在补时阶段进球。他在伤停补时把球送进网窝。他的进球为热刺抢回一分。", "这个结果意味着两队各拿一分。曼联继续留在英超。热刺也从客场带走一分。"], "body": "Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 on Sunday. The match was at Old Trafford, United's home stadium. It was a feisty game with many strong challenges.\n\nTottenham had only ten players for part of the match. A player got a red card. But the team did not give up.\n\nDominic Solanke scored in added time. He found the net in stoppage time. His goal saved a point for Tottenham.\n\nThe result means both teams take one point. United stay in the Premier League. Tottenham also get one point from the away game.", "body_zh": "周日，曼联与托特纳姆热刺1-1战平。比赛在曼联的主场老特拉福德进行。这是一场火药味十足的比赛，身体对抗很多。\n\n热刺在比赛的一部分时间里只有十名球员。一名球员被红牌罚下。但球队没有放弃。\n\n多米尼克·索兰克在补时阶段进球。他在伤停补时把球送进网窝。他的进球为热刺抢回一分。\n\n这个结果意味着两队各拿一分。曼联继续留在英超。热刺也从客场带走一分。", "text": "Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 on Sunday. The match was at Old Trafford, United's home stadium. It was a feisty game with many strong challenges. Tottenham had only ten players for part of the match. A player got a red card. But the team did not give up. Dominic Solanke scored in added time. He found the net in stoppage time. His goal saved a point for Tottenham. The result means both teams take one point. United stay in the Premier League. Tottenham also get one point from the away ga